x=\"0\">Bekijk ons werk</span></td><td><span class=\"btn btn-secondary is-disabled\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Bekijk ons werk</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"label\"><b>Ghost</b></td><td><span class=\"btn btn-ghost \" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Lees meer</span></td><td><span class=\"btn btn-ghost is-hover\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Lees meer</span></td><td><span class=\"btn btn-ghost is-focus\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Lees meer</span></td><td><span class=\"btn btn-ghost is-disabled\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Lees meer</span></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"sect\"><div class=\"sect-head\"><span class=\"label\">Invoerveld</span><span class=\"label\">Toestanden</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"c3\"><p class=\"label cap-top\">Standaard</p><div class=\"field\"><span class=\"small\">E-mailadres</span><div class=\"input is-placeholder\" role=\"textbox\" tabindex=\"0\">naam@bedrijf.nl</div><span class=\"hint \">We mailen alleen over je aanvraag.</span></div></div><div class=\"c3\"><p class=\"label cap-top\">Focus</p><div class=\"field\"><span class=\"small\">E-mailadres</span><div class=\"input is-focus\" role=\"textbox\" tabindex=\"0\">sanne@voorbeeld</div><span class=\"hint \">We mailen alleen over je aanvraag.</span></div></div><div class=\"c3\"><p class=\"label cap-top\">Fout</p><div class=\"field\"><span class=\"small\">E-mailadres</span><div class=\"input is-error\" role=\"textbox\" tabindex=\"0\">sanne@voorbeeld</div><span class=\"hint is-error\">Vul een volledig e-mailadres in.</span></div></div><div class=\"c3\"><p class=\"label cap-top\">Uitgeschakeld</p><div class=\"field\"><span class=\"small\">Bedrijfsnaam</span><div class=\"input is-disabled\" role=\"textbox\" tabindex=\"-1\">TEST-Bakkerij Zonnig</div><span class=\"hint \">Staat al vast in je account.</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sect\"><div class=\"sect-head\"><span class=\"label\">Kaarten</span><span class=\"label\">Radius lg · schaduw sm</span></div><div class=\"grid cards\"><div class=\"c4\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"photo\"><img class=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524758631624-e2822e304c36?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Licht interieur met lamp, stoelen en houten kasten\"></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p class=\"label\">Project · 2026</p><p class=\"h3\">Nieuwe huisstijl voor een meubelmaker</p><p class=\"small muted\">Van logo tot showroom, in acht weken.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"c4\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><p class=\"label\">Dienst</p><p class=\"h3\">Merkstrategie</p><p class=\"small muted\">Twee sessies, één helder verhaal: wie je bent, voor wie, en waarom ze jou kiezen.</p><span class=\"btn btn-secondary\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Meer over strategie</span></div></article></div><div class=\"c4\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><p class=\"label\">Gemiddeld</p><p class=\"stat\">6 weken</p><p class=\"small muted\">van eerste schets tot livegang, gemeten over 2025.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"sect\"><div class=\"sect-head\"><span class=\"label\">Koppen en citaat</span><span class=\"label\"></span></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"c6 stack\"><p class=\"title\" style=\"font-size:var(--brand-text-h1-size);line-height:var(--brand-text-h1-line)\">We maken je merk af</p><p class=\"h2\">Van strategie tot website</p><p class=\"h3\">In één team, zonder overdracht</p><p class=\"muted\">Lopende tekst staat op Inter 17/1,6 met hoogstens 70 tekens per regel.</p></div><div class=\"c6\"><blockquote class=\"qt\"><p class=\"quote\">“Ze vroegen eerst wat er al goed ging. Daarna klopte alles.”</p><p class=\"label cap\">TEST-klant · eigenaar meubelmakerij</p></blockquote></div></div></section><footer class=\"foot\"><span class=\"label\">TEST-Studio Noord · Designsysteem v1.0 · nov 2026</span><span class=\"label\">06 / 08</span></footer></main><script>(function () {var light = null, dark = null;for (var s = 0; s < document.styleSheets.length; s++) {try {var rules = document.styleSheets[s].cssRules;for (var i = 0; i < rules.length; i++) {var r = rules[i];if (r.selectorText === ':root' && r.style.getPropertyValue('--brand-color-bg')) light = r.style;if (r.media && /dark/.test(r.media.mediaText) && r.cssRules.length && r.cssRules[0].style.getPropertyValue('--brand-color-bg')) dark = r.cssRules[0].style;}} catch (e) {}}var buttons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-scheme]');if (!light || !dark) { document.querySelector('.scheme').hidden = true; return; }function show(mode) {var from = mode === 'dark' ? dark : light;for (var k = 0; k < dark.length; k++) document.documentElement.style.setProperty(dark[k], from.getPropertyValue(dark[k]));for (var j = 0; j < buttons.length; j++) buttons[j].setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(buttons[j].getAttribute('data-scheme') === mode));}for (var b = 0; b < buttons.length; b++) buttons[b].addEventListener('click', function () { show(this.getAttribute('data-scheme')); });})();</script></body></html>",
